second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which country is Chintamani Acharya a citizen of?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 22, \"text\": \"**Chintamani Acharya**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 24, \"end\": 165, \"text\": \"Chintamani Acharya (born 1885) is an Indian lawyer and writer, best known for his literary contributions to the Indian independence movement.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 166, \"end\": 280, \"text\": \"However, what is lesser known about Acharya is his unique citizenship status as a citizen of the Kingdom of Italy.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 281, \"end\": 309, \"text\": \"**Early Life and Education**\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 311, \"end\": 382, \"text\": \"Acharya was born in Bombay, British India, to a family of modest means.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 383, \"end\": 546, \"text\": \"Despite the challenges he faced, Acharya's intellectual prowess and passion for learning earned him a scholarship to study law at the University of Turin in Italy.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 547, \"end\": 708, \"text\": \"It was during his time in Italy that Acharya developed a deep appreciation for the country's culture and history, which would later influence his literary works.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 709, \"end\": 736, \"text\": \"**Citizenship Controversy**\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 738, \"end\": 921, \"text\": \"In 1905, Acharya's application for Italian citizenship was approved by King Victor Emmanuel III, making him one of the first Indians to be granted citizenship of the Kingdom of Italy.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 922, \"end\": 1052, \"text\": \"This decision was met with controversy, as some argued that Acharya's Indian heritage made him ineligible for Italian citizenship.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1053, \"end\": 1210, \"text\": \"However, Acharya's supporters pointed to his extensive knowledge of Italian language and culture, as well as his contributions to the Italian literary scene.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1211, \"end\": 1237, \"text\": \"**Studies and References**\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1239, \"end\": 1348, \"text\": \"Several studies have explored Acharya's unique citizenship status and its implications on his literary works.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1349, \"end\": 1556, \"text\": \"A 2010 study published in the Journal of Italian Studies found that Acharya's Italian citizenship had a significant impact on his writing style, with many of his works reflecting Italian literary influences.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1557, \"end\": 1560, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1562, \"end\": 1609, \"text\": \"In his 2015 biography of Acharya, historian Dr.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1610, \"end\": 1737, \"text\": \"Ramesh Chandra noted that Acharya's Italian citizenship was a testament to his ability to navigate complex cultural identities.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1738, \"end\": 1741, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1743, \"end\": 1757, \"text\": \"**References**\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1759, \"end\": 1832, \"text\": \"[1] \\\"The Italian Influence on Chintamani Acharya's Literary Works\\\" by Dr.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1833, \"end\": 1878, \"text\": \"Maria Rossi, Journal of Italian Studies, Vol.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1879, \"end\": 1886, \"text\": \"42, No.\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1887, \"end\": 1895, \"text\": \"3, 2010.\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1896, \"end\": 1956, \"text\": \"[2] \\\"Chintamani Acharya: A Life of Literary Activism\\\" by Dr.\"}, \"D1S25\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1957, \"end\": 2003, \"text\": \"Ramesh Chandra, Oxford University Press, 2015.\"}, \"D1S26\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2004, \"end\": 2022, \"text\": \"**External Links**\"}, \"D1S27\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2024, \"end\": 2092, \"text\": \"* University of Turin Archives: Chintamani Acharya's Student Records\"}, \"D1S28\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2093, \"end\": 2150, \"text\": \"* Italian Ministry of Interior: Citizenship Records, 1905\"}, \"D1S29\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2152, \"end\": 2242, \"text\": \"Note: The above Wikipedia entry is entirely fictional and for demonstration purposes only.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 67, \"text\": \"Title: The Life and Times of Chintamani Acharya: A Citizen of India\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 69, \"end\": 239, \"text\": \"In the heart of South Asia, where the majestic Himalayas meet the vast expanse of the Indian subcontinent, lies a country rich in history, culture, and diversity - India.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 240, \"end\": 416, \"text\": \"It is here, in this vibrant nation, that we find the remarkable story of Chintamani Acharya, a lawyer and writer who has left an indelible mark on the fabric of Indian society.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 417, \"end\": 561, \"text\": \"Born and raised in India, Chintamani Acharya's life is a testament to the country's values of resilience, hard work, and intellectual curiosity.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 562, \"end\": 713, \"text\": \"As a lawyer, he has spent years navigating the complexities of India's legal system, fighting for justice and upholding the rights of the marginalized.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 714, \"end\": 816, \"text\": \"His dedication to his craft has earned him the respect of his peers and the admiration of his clients.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 817, \"end\": 871, \"text\": \"But Acharya's impact extends far beyond the courtroom.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 872, \"end\": 1006, \"text\": \"As a writer, he has used his words to inspire and educate, shedding light on the intricacies of Indian politics, culture, and history.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1007, \"end\": 1127, \"text\": \"His writings have been widely read and acclaimed, offering a unique perspective on the country's struggles and triumphs.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1128, \"end\": 1269, \"text\": \"One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Acharya's citizenship is his deep understanding of India's constitutional framework.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1270, \"end\": 1427, \"text\": \"In his writings, he has demonstrated a mastery of the country's laws and regulations, often citing specific articles and amendments to support his arguments.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1428, \"end\": 1540, \"text\": \"This level of expertise can only be acquired through years of study and practice within the Indian legal system.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1541, \"end\": 1689, \"text\": \"Furthermore, Acharya's involvement in various social and political movements in India is a testament to his commitment to the country's development.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1690, \"end\": 1876, \"text\": \"He has been an outspoken advocate for human rights, women's empowerment, and environmental protection, using his platform to raise awareness about the issues that matter most to Indians.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1877, \"end\": 1951, \"text\": \"Acharya's connection to India is not limited to his professional pursuits.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1952, \"end\": 2022, \"text\": \"His personal life is deeply rooted in the country's cultural heritage.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2023, \"end\": 2189, \"text\": \"He is fluent in multiple Indian languages, including Hindi, Bengali, and Marathi, and has a deep appreciation for the country's rich literary and artistic traditions.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2190, \"end\": 2339, \"text\": \"His love for Indian cuisine, music, and festivals is evident in his writings, which often weave together stories of family, tradition, and community.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2340, \"end\": 2408, \"text\": \"In addition, Acharya's family ties to India are strong and enduring.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2409, \"end\": 2525, \"text\": \"His ancestors have lived in the country for generations, contributing to its growth and development in various ways.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Kingdom of Italy\", \"India\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Kingdom of Italy\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"India\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
      }
